Which of these is the correct syntax for the `useCallback` hook?

**A.** ```js
const handleClick = useCallback(() => { /* code */ }, dependency);
```

**B.** ```jsx
const handleClick = useCallback(() => { /* code */ }, [dependency]);
```

**C.** ```js
const handleClick = useCallback(() => { dependency }, {});
```

**D.** ```js
const handleClick = useCallback(() => { /* code */ });
```

